  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DSB - Disaster Risk Reduction</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Allocation to The Norwegian Directorate for Civil Protection (DSB) over the Ministry of Foreign Affairs&#x2019; budget, for tasks DSB is to manage related Disaster Risk Reduction. The support covers the follow-up of the UN Environment Programme related to the prevention of and response to acute environmental incidents,  through DSB&apos;s participation in meetings of the Strategic Advisory Group on Environmental Emergencies (SAGEE). The support also covers Norway&#x2019;s participation in the G20 process on disaster risk reduction, which falls under DSB&#x2019;s role as the national focal point for the Sendai Framework. The support also funded participation in the Global Platform for UNDRR.</narrative>
  </description>
